## Session Context (LeWM-MCP)

You have access to LeWorldModel (LeWM) MCP server: train/eval job control, checkpoint management, and agentic planning.

**Before starting work:**
1. Check upstream health: `lewm_world(operation="health")`
2. List available checkpoints: `lewm_world(operation="checkpoint_list")`
3. Check recent jobs: `lewm_world(operation="job_status")`

**At end of work:**
- Stop any running GPU jobs: `lewm_world(operation="job_stop")`
